PART 3: INSTALLING BOOTSTRAP ICONS
================================================================================

STEP 1: INSTALL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Run:

npm i bootstrap-icons


The package becomes a project dependency.


================================================================================
STEP 2: IMPORT THE ICON FONT CSS
================================================================================

A good approach is to import it once at the application's entry point.

For Vite:

src/main.jsx


Example:

import { StrictMode } from 'react'

import {
  createRoot
} from 'react-dom/client'

import 'bootstrap-icons/font/bootstrap-icons.css'

import App
  from './App.jsx'

import './index.css'


createRoot(
  document.getElementById(
    'root'
  )
).render(

  <StrictMode>

    <App />

  </StrictMode>

)


================================================================================
WHY IMPORT IT ONCE?
================================================================================

Avoid repeatedly importing:

bootstrap-icons/font/bootstrap-icons.css


inside:

GroceryItem.jsx

AddGroceryForm.jsx

Navigation.jsx

Footer.jsx


if Bootstrap Icons are used throughout the application.


A single global import makes the dependency clear:

main.jsx
   ↓
Bootstrap Icons CSS
   ↓
Available Throughout App


================================================================================
STEP 3: USE AN ICON
================================================================================

Example:

<i
  className="bi bi-trash"
  aria-hidden="true"
></i>


================================================================================
STEP 4: VERIFY
================================================================================

You can verify the package installation with:

npm list bootstrap-icons


Do not hard-code an expected version number into learning notes unless your
project intentionally pins that version.

The installed version can change as the package is updated.


================================================================================
INSTALLATION FLOW
================================================================================

npm i bootstrap-icons
        ↓
node_modules
        ↓
Import Icons CSS
        ↓
Use bi Classes
        ↓
Browser Renders Icon Font


