================================================================================
IMPORTANT PRICE FIX
================================================================================

If using:

bi-currency-dollar


the icon itself visually represents the currency symbol.

Therefore:

<i className="bi bi-currency-dollar"></i>
{lineCost.toFixed(2)}


is enough.


Avoid:

<i className="bi bi-currency-dollar"></i>
${lineCost.toFixed(2)}


if the visual result unnecessarily becomes:

$ $7.98


Another perfectly valid option is:

NO CURRENCY ICON

and simply:

${lineCost.toFixed(2)}


Use one clear currency presentation.


