DECORATIVE ICONS
================================================================================

Example:

<span className="item-category">

  <i
    className="bi bi-tag"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></i>

  Dairy

</span>


The word:

Dairy


already communicates the information.


Therefore the tag icon is decorative:

aria-hidden="true"


================================================================================
ICON-ONLY BUTTON
================================================================================

Example:

<button
  type="button"
  aria-label="Delete Milk"
>

  <i
    className="bi bi-trash"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></i>

</button>


The icon is hidden from assistive technology.

The BUTTON supplies the accessible name.


